<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  .header-logo { float: right; margin-top: 0; }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Semester for which you are seeking readmission:</p>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Date:</label>
      <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Student Number:</label>
      <span data-field="student_number">{{ student_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Full Name:</label>
      <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Current Address:</label>
      <span data-field="current_address">{{ current_address }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Phone Number:</label>
      <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Email Address:</label>
      <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <label>Degree Program:</label>
      <span data-field="degree_program">{{ degree_program }}</span>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <p>Provide a concise explanation of those mitigating circumstances that the College of Arts, Sciences, and Engineering Graduate Appeals Committee should consider relative to your dismissal (attach additional sheets if necessary).</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <p>Please provide the committee with an explanation of why you expect to do better academic work if reinstated (attach additional sheets if necessary).</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
      <p>Please send this form and any other documentation that you deem appropriate to support your readmission to <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>